# Generated row masks for the association and orbit certificates

This file is generated by `generate_association_transport_data.py`.  A binary matrix is
presented by the list of its rows, each row the natural number whose set bits are the
columns carrying the entry one.  The first four lists are the 78-by-78 adjacency matrices
of the elliptic relations with normalized polar invariants 0, 9, 10 and 12 on the ordered
internal points; the last four are the transposes of the 91-by-78 support matrices of the
four minimum-word orbits.  Lean checks every list against the semantic Boolean matrix it
encodes; the lists carry no trust of their own.
-/

